 cycle | Dryers: Two (2) Front-Load Professional Dryers — $2.00 per cycle | RV Dump | We provide on-site RV dump services. Our dump station allows RVers to safely and efficiently dispose of t", "n allows RVers to safely and efficiently dispose of their waste. The service is available to the public, ensuring a clean and hassle-free experience for those needing to manage their RV sanitation systems. | | | *Price: $9.43 plus tax | RV Water Fill | We offer on-site RV water fill stations for our guests. Our conveniently located water stations allows campers to safely and efficiently fill their RV fresh water tank", "veniently located water stations allows campers to safely and efficiently fill their RV fresh water tanks. RV water fill is available to the publicand for those who need to fill their RV fresh water tanks. | | | *Price: $4.69 plus tax | Water Fill | We offer on-site water fill services for totes and other larger water storage containers. Our conveniently located water station allows anyone to safely and efficiently f", "ently fill their water storage containers with fresh water. This service is available to the public, providing a easy experience for those needing to replenish their water supply for various storage needs. | | | *Price: $4.69 plus tax for up to 30 gallons, for quantities over 30 gallons, $0.14/gallon plus tax | Public Showers | We offer on-site public shower facilities. Our clean and well-maintained shower room provi", "ic shower facilities. Our clean and well-maintained shower room provides hot water and ample space. Available to the public, our showers ensure a convenient and refreshing option for anyone needing access. | | | *Price: $4.69 plus tax | RV Storage | We offer on-site RV storage services. Our storage area allows anyone to store their RVs when not in use. Available to the public, we provide an accessible solution for th", "n use. Available to the public, we provide an accessible solution for those needing a space to keep their RVs. The space is designed to accommodate various RV sizes, ensuring flexibility for all customers. | | | *Price: $35/month for the first 30ft of RV length, an additional $1/month for each additional foot over 30ft. | Mailboxes | We offer mailbox services to our campers and non-guests. The Desert Oasis Campground", "ervices to our campers and non-guests. The Desert Oasis Campground is not responsible for lost, stolen, or damaged mail once delivered to the assigned CBU slot, provided reasonable care is taken. | | | *Price: | Guests: $12/month per site for access to a dedicated CBU slot, including key and mail notifications. | Non-Guests: $15/month for access to a dedicated CBU slot, including key and mail notifications. | *Please"], "via": "Services"}]}
